  "releaseNotes": "# AID Studio v3.0.0\n\n## 中文\n\n### 新增与优化\n\n- 首页默认进入自由画布，可切换至剧本成片。公开画布页提供个人项目入口，新建成功后直接进入编辑器。\n- 自由画布支持项目协作，预装全能画布、原创编剧与编辑改编、空间镜头预演和 3D-HUB 所需的四个内置助手及其基础 Skill。\n- 预演台可直接返回文字空间方案。3D-HUB 场景建模需要受支持的运行时和计算节点。\n- 管理后台按七个业务分类组织菜单，合并相关入口，保留已有角色授权和兼容入口。可管理 Agent、Skill、画布权益、白模资产、计算节点及供应商余额监控。\n- 默认文本模型为 DeepSeek Flash。使用文本能力前，请在管理后台配置可用的供应商凭证。\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复自托管站点的画布协作和助手实时连接，包括普通 HTTP 环境下的重连和跨标签页操作。\n- 修复普通 HTTP 下的剧本正文读取和完整性校验。原创编剧在计划确认后执行真实节点写入，重复确认请求不会创建重复节点。\n- 修复新安装数据中的角色、场景、道具和特效文件引用。官方媒体素材可单独导入。\n- 移除 JWT 签名和开发 MySQL 的固定默认凭证。新装自动生成并保存随机凭证，升级继续使用已有配置。直接启动后端需提供 `TOKEN_SECRET` 和 `DB_PASSWORD`。\n\n### 安装、升级与兼容性\n\n- 新安装使用 `sql/aid-init.sql`。最小部署可使用内置 MySQL、Redis 和本地存储，RocketMQ 为可选项。\n- 本版验证的最低一键直升版本为 `2.2.4`，增量文件为 `sql/v3.0.0.sql`。旧库升级前需要完成 Skill 历史身份归一，按部署说明执行，保留已有业务数据和配置。\n- 升级前请备份数据库、配置和上传文件，并暂停新的生成请求。自定义供应商凭证、角色授权和已启用的自定义助手绑定按迁移规则保留。\n\n## English\n\n### What's new\n\n- The home page opens Canvas by default and still offers the script-to-video workflow. The canvas gallery links to personal projects and opens the editor after a project is created.\n- Canvas adds project collaboration and four starter agents with core skills for general canvas work, original screenwriting and adaptation, spatial previs, and 3D-HUB.\n- Spatial previs can return text guidance directly. Scene construction in 3D-HUB requires a supported runtime and a compute worker.\n- The admin console groups menus into seven areas, consolidates related pages, and retains existing role grants and compatible entry points. It includes agents, skills, canvas entitlements, proxy assets, compute workers, and provider balance monitoring.\n- DeepSeek Flash is the default text model. Configure valid provider credentials before using text generation.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fixed realtime collaboration and assistant sessions on self-hosted deployments, including reconnects and cross-tab use over HTTP.\n- Fixed reading and verifying screenplay text over HTTP. A confirmed screenwriting plan now writes to a canvas node, and replaying the same confirmation does not create a duplicate.\n- Corrected starter references for character, scene, prop, and effect files. Official media assets can be imported separately.\n- Removed the fixed default JWT secret and development MySQL password. New installs generate and store random credentials. Upgrades reuse the existing configuration. Direct backend launches require `TOKEN_SECRET` and `DB_PASSWORD`.\n\n### Installation and upgrade\n\n- A fresh install uses `sql/aid-init.sql`. A minimal deployment can use built-in MySQL, Redis, and local storage. RocketMQ is optional.\n- The earliest verified source version for one-click upgrade is `2.2.4`. The migration is `sql/v3.0.0.sql`. Follow the deployment guide for historical skill identity normalization before migrating an existing database.\n- Back up your database, configuration, and uploads, and pause new generation requests before upgrading. Migration rules preserve existing provider credentials, role grants, and established custom agent bindings.",
